02:22:14.962 SET-FIELD PROBE IS ON - which by now means 'the channel answers at all'. The
02:22:14.962   flag is a misnomer kept for the launch line: without it Session::handle
02:22:14.963   returns nothing for every packet, so the migration hello goes unanswered and
02:22:14.963   the client freezes on 'Connecting...'.
