02:22:14.963   carrying the character's real record (presence[0] the stat block, presence[2]
02:22:14.963   the equipped list), 0x00DC with that field's NPCs and mobs, 0x00D1 with the
02:22:14.963   portal's destination, 0x00E7 with the !map GM command, and 0x0151 with a
02:22:14.963   script Say, 0x0104 with the NPC shop, and 0x00D2 with a channel migration.
02:22:14.963   CONFIRMED on a real client: the dressed character, the bag and its 125 slots,
02:22:14.963   NPC dialogue, mobs spawning and moving, an unequip that survives a map change.
02:22:14.963   NOT yet seen on screen: the shop counter, the quest journal, the channel
02:22:14.963   switch. Dropping an item is refused on purpose - there is nowhere to put it.
